Vercel Web Analytics Installation - Implementation Report
==========================================================

Successfully installed and configured Vercel Web Analytics for the Kodo client project.

## What Was Implemented

### 1. Fetched Latest Documentation
- Retrieved the official Vercel Analytics quickstart guide from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart
- Confirmed framework-specific instructions for Next.js App Router

### 2. Package Installation
- Installed `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1 using npm
- Package added to dependencies in package.json
- Updated package-lock.json to reflect the new dependency

### 3. Code Integration
Modified: `src/app/layout.tsx`
- Added import statement: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";`
- Added `<Analytics />` component inside the `<body>` tag, after the `{children}` element

## Implementation Details

The Analytics component was added to the root layout file following the official Vercel documentation for Next.js App Router projects. This ensures:
- Analytics tracking is available across all pages
- Route changes are automatically tracked
- Seamless integration with Next.js routing system

## Files Modified

1. `src/app/layout.tsx` - Added Analytics import and component
2. `package.json` - Added @vercel/analytics dependency
3. `package-lock.json` - Updated with new dependency tree

## Verification

✅ Build Test: Successfully built the production version using `npm run build`
✅ Linting: No linting errors introduced in layout.tsx
✅ TypeScript: No type errors, successful compilation

## Next Steps

To enable analytics data collection:
1. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard under the Analytics section
2. Deploy the project to Vercel using `vercel deploy`
3. Access analytics data in the Vercel dashboard after deployment

## Notes

- The existing code structure was preserved completely
- No breaking changes were introduced
- The implementation follows Next.js App Router best practices
- Analytics will only collect data when deployed on Vercel
